WEBVTT

NOTE
Brothers - Brotherly Love. Sacred and Minotaur summon.
Observed duration in reference video: ~22 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Brothers. Brotherly Love.

00:02.500 --> 00:07.000
The earth cracks open. Minotaur, a hulking red-skinned giant with curved horns, surfaces first.

00:07.000 --> 00:11.000
Sacred, his small green-skinned brother, scrambles up beside him.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
Minotaur tears a colossal slab of bedrock from the ground and hoists it overhead.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
He hurls the boulder down on the enemies; the field erupts in dust and rubble.

00:20.000 --> 00:22.000
Both brothers sink back into the earth.
